83189926956_p54q3lg","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1327},{"id":1783180995220,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"记下来了！谢谢莱昂德尔先生的指导！我这就去准备防腐罐子。","timestamp":"2026-07-04T18:32:51.486Z","roundId":"group_round_1783189926956_p54q3lg","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1328},{"id":1783180995221,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"@维什卡 如果需要的话，我这里还有一些多余的解毒剂，等下我和亲爱的去黑森林之前，可以顺路给你们带过去一点。","timestamp":"2026-07-04T18:32:54.310Z","roundId":"group_round_1783189926956_p54q3lg","reactions":["😭"],"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1329},{"id":1783180995222,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"亲、亲爱的早上好……早饭已经做好了哦，是您昨天点名的枫糖松饼，快起来洗漱吧~","timestamp":"2026-07-04T18:32:56.929Z","roundId":"group_round_1783189883616_j28o2ho","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1330},{"id":1783180995223,"sender":"them","text":"饲养员大人……饼干有点烫，我在床边吹凉了再喂您好不好？吃完我们再去黑森林看小树……","timestamp":"2026-07-04T18:32:58.023Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":1331},{"id":1783180995224,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"早上好。看来昨晚的植物探讨让您连做梦都在构思新配方了。不过还是要注意休息。","timestamp":"2026-07-04T18:32:59.513Z","roundId":"group_round_1783189883616_j28o2ho","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1332},{"id":1783180995225,"sender":"them","text":"如果您今天有空的话，温室的红茶随时为您准备着。","timestamp":"2026-07-04T18:33:01.293Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"3cd1c1d